<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center h4 site-name" style="text-transform:lowercase">the stripe</h2>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center site-byline">by GRACE ATWOOD</h2>



<p class="has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph">The Stripe is a lifestyle blog for the stylish bookworm. Since its first post in 2010, it has aimed to be a daily source of inspiration for the modern woman. Written by Grace Atwood, The Stripe aims to leave you feeling like you just had coffee with a great girlfriend: savvier, more confident, and always learning something new.</p>


